cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "skillscan: scan an AI agent skill or MCP server before you install it"
version: 0.10.1
date-released: 2026-11-20
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/skillscan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/skillscan"
abstract: >-
  Reads an AI-agent skill folder or MCP server before installation and gives
  one plain-English verdict — BLOCK, CAUTION, or PASS — from deterministic
  rules. An optional LLM review mode can add findings on top; it can never
  remove or change the deterministic verdict.
keywords:
  - agent skills
  - MCP
  - security scanner
  - SKILL.md
  - deterministic
